le__om9dLG__markInk" style="--logo-mask:url(&quot;https://assets.claude.com/9e41cfddbba5e6a5670176a96ed94b6c72e3de8f.svg&quot;);--mark-w:2.056;--mark-h:0.4864" role="img" aria-label="Mid-Ohio Food Collective"></span><div class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__photo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__mark CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__markLight" style="--logo-mask:url(&quot;https://assets.claude.com/9e41cfddbba5e6a5670176a96ed94b6c72e3de8f.svg&quot;);--mark-w:2.056;--mark-h:0.4864"></span></div><span class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__edge" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__body"><h3 class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__title text-body-2">Mid-Ohio Food Collective rebuilds the software behind 2,500 food pantries with Claude</h3></div></a><a href="/customers/montgomery-county-food-bank" class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__card CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__cardCountOn"><div class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__plate"><span class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__mark CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__markInk" style="--logo-mask:url(&quot;https://assets.claude.com/33ae695ef18cfa622c450da00c7aec3c10b63d10.svg&quot;);--mark-w:1.8306;--mark-h:0.5463" role="img" aria-label="Montgomery County Food Bank"></span><div class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__photo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__mark CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__markLight" style="--logo-mask:url(&quot;https://assets.claude.com/33ae695ef18cfa622c450da00c7aec3c10b63d10.svg&quot;);--mark-w:1.8306;--mark-h:0.5463"></span></div><span class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__edge" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__body"><h3 class="CardHub-module-scss-module__om9dLG__title text-body-2">Montgomery County Food Bank extends a small team’s reach across the county with Claude</h3></div></a><a href="/custo