and org spend limits\",\"hySAiYaQPB\":\"Customer story: {name}\",\"hzIXh+zWXq\":\"Sign-in\",\"i6/NVPwbXS\":\"Set org instructions\",\"i6X4YUnoI+\":\"Code execution\",\"iA09r91Nhi\":\"Data Analysis \u0026 Business Intelligence\",\"iKZ+rED3h9\":\"Search the Claude Marketplace\",\"iQYFHFpp2/\":\"Start building\",\"iSqBnkauND\":\"Show featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"iUZG3VKE6X\":\"Batch\",\"iXpep1vGVo\":\"Recent\",\"iY7lfhlPVd\":\"Keep context, instructions, and files organized by project.\",\"iYRFrGt6Mf\":\"$$200\",\"iZxsimeRjv\":\"Play video: {name}\",\"ia3TbSw0MB\":\"Anthropic Products\",\"igUl+YO/B4\":\"Claude takes real actions on your files and in connected tools. You choose which plugins Claude can use — it works only in the folders and tools you allow.\",\"ih0VppR08P\":\"{n} of {count}\",\"ii5+AISEyS\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"ijMdGR7OO4\":\"Cross-check 34 issues and 34 PRs\",\"inUkccnHv6\":\"Set preferences that apply across every conversation.\",\"ioH+Q/t3aY\":\"See all features and pricing\",\"isGKnzG5uL\":\"Documentation\",\"it6Ligcq3B\":\"Input\",\"iuSNLHoe8Z\":\"Get a comprehensive university‐wide plan for an institution, including its students, faculty, and staff.\",\"iun6grW2C+\":\"Claude Consumption / FinOps Optimisation\",\"iwE5pm/oXq\":\"Contract redline\",\"ize18jQXCF\":\"Now standing: Mondays before staff meeting\",\"j/NXahNfg2\":\"Briefs\",\"j2hlcpE79k\":\"Browser use\",\"jB1nSrwP8X\":\"{count, plural, one {# webinar} other {# webinars}}\",\"jCxscTUx/w\":\"Watch the recording\",\"jI62MY64Qn\":\"Other\",\"jKKg2of6uk\":\"Clear all filters\",\"jLXY9o1l5R\":\"Customer success support at certain spend thresholds\",\"jSd3FgIcuH\":\"Step-by-s"])</script><script nonce="Ut3oYdma4O818PG+BaBRaw==">self.__next_f.push([1,"tep walkthroughs and practical playbooks for getting the most out of Claude.\",\"jWt3I/bVbN\":\"Save 50% with batch processing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"jcwE2sEK9f\":\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\",\"jeFrcRK7Eo\":\"Claude Code is included in your Max plan. Great value for everyday use in larger codebases. Includes $100 per month in API credits.\",\"jewMdfuvaC\":\"{variant, select, brief {Next brief} report {Next report} other {Next guide}}\",\"jfCrPjcoTy\":\"Alphabetically (Z to A)\",\"jg76pPXsb3\":\"How fast you reach a limit depends on the model you use, how long your chats are, and how large your files are.\",\"jgPXwd1foX\":\"Product:\",\"jhr0P2VITB\":\"Managed AI Operations\",\"jm/spnRSn+\":\"Reset\",\"js+IVaPpb9\":\"Chapter {number}\",\"jsHFp13ghq\":\"Demos, talks, and tutorials from the teams building and using Claude.\",\"jtygmIHCQ1\":\"Education\",\"jvODrZtR+p\":\"Select\",\"jw+K5d+CdN\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at standard API pricing.\",\"jw7DDs8FJv\":\"Office Locations (On-Site Services)\",\"jx7Hn3QkH8\":\"Article\",\"k0OtSnRsC6\":\"Claude Code is designed with security in mind. When used in your terminal, Claude Code runs locally and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for permission before making changes to your files or running commands.\",\"k2veDAJW1p\":\"Write\",\"k4+9FsLhU8\":\"On consumption-based plans.\",\"k8cDUYjZKq\":\"Add to Claude\",\"kBJUtE9oHc\":\"Video\",\"kBa7elYtHL\":\"Earnings comps\",\"kFe6I3hifr\":\"Close capabilities\",\"kG2B8TG1wp\":\"Up to $500/month\",\"kGPBjqFz6l\":\"Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"kVrpkF04ro\":\"Webinars\",\"kdUZJIKMMe\":\"Global (any region)\",\"kfiCd53EoX\":\"stories\",\"kh/sk1M1PF\":\"Here are this month’s regional actuals exports. Reconcile them into one summary, flag any variances against budget, and note anything that doesn’t tie out.\",\"khjKGjoVqR\":\"View source\",\"kkjl2vQekD\":\"Max\",\"kkm29b5t2g\":\"Connectors, plugins and API integrations\",\"kmWDaKdQa7\":\"Downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing period, and your chats, projects, and files stay with your account whichever plan you're on.\",\"krcRxpVfJ7\":\"Travel \u0026 Hospitality\",\"ktRQ8OmQ1C\":\"If you're in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, and within your 14-day withdrawal period, you can request a refund directly in the app.\",\"kvOMtBRD9I\":\"Credit card\",\"kwoQygB+wc\":\"Canceling doesn't delete your data. Your chats, projects, and files stay with your account, though some features aren't available on the Free plan. For Pro, Max, and Ultra, your account moves to the Free plan once the period ends. For step-by-step help, see \u003ca\u003ehow to cancel a Pro, Max, or Ultra plan\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003ecancel a Team plan\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"kxmEvL+JcO\":\"\u003ca\u003eMax and Ultra\u003c/a\u003e are built for people who work with Claude throughout the day and want longer, uninterrupted sessions. You get everything in Pro, plus more usage. Max gives you 5x the usage of Pro, every 5 hours and every week. Ultra gives you 10x the weekly usage of Pro, with no 5-hour limit for \u003cb\u003everified accounts\u003c/b\u003e. Both plans include Fable, our top model, for up to half your weekly limit, and a monthly API credit to build on the Claude Platform: $100 on Max, $200 on Ultra. Both plans are billed monthly. See the cards above for current pricing.\",\"kyuy4QAduP\":\"The board deck five. Whatever tier they push hardest.\",\"kzQgd/+809\":\"Product overview\",\"l/bdoV65Uq\":\"Close (Esc)\",\"l0cx8sfvyN\":\"Consultation\",\"l6yCDglZqT\":\"Continue with email\",\"lBAoMMkYNE\":\"Horizontal / Cross-industry\",\"lDLuhpAPUD\":\"Opus\",\"lN0CJi045d\":\"Permissions control\",\"lRdUjp0Vbo\":\"Files and folders\",\"lVREK+O2A7\":\"Claude Security (beta)\",\"lXFbqgnTzj\":\"Hand off and schedule tasks\",\"lbr3Lq2Lnm\":\"Copy link\",\"lbtOA3j+V3\":\"Require that any accounts using your domain migrate to your organization\",\"lcRZ9HSjkB\":\"Administrative tools for Team and Enterprise\",\"lcjzsP/DJa\":\"Per month with annual subscription discount (\u003cannual\u003e$200\u003c/annual\u003e billed up front). \u003cmonthly\u003e$20\u003c/monthly\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"lgU1HeQGw4\":\"Global Premier"])</script><script nonce="Ut3oYdma4O818PG+BaBRaw==">self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"lh0xe+kwtT\":\"Works with\",\"ll/ufR0/ED\":\"Trending\",\"lpFUMU324g\":\"Compliance API for observability and monitoring\",\"lu3AvZt5aS\":\"Research, benchmarks, and analysis on how AI is changing the way organizations build, plan, and operate.\",\"ludPcY9ukn\":\"Compare features across plans\",\"lw49qiF68V\":\"Let Claude write and run code to build files like spreadsheets, presentations, and docs for you.\",\"m0TzBiIhvZ\":\"Central billing and administration\",\"m7v1ahj/te\":\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\",\"mABpZRe7C5\":\"The developer newsletter\",\"mG4nNtNqKg\":\"Updated {date}\",\"mIV5za3QLY\":\"Draft 11 field updates, nothing saved\",\"mKkfuHn2hN\":\"More information\",\"mVaGK86OHA\":\"From {tool}\",\"mVkTZZgH2a\":\"Plugin\",\"mWIVle/RBJ\":\"Date\",\"mWPRGNJ4Uw\":\"Convert EMEA at the July average, 1.088\",\"mWVI74nTV2\":\"Ask and artifact\",\"meOv8JJVYB\":\"Chat with buying specialist\",\"mnJYBQZwb4\":\"Voice\",\"mofX8KnW9/\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. \u003ca\u003eSee full system requirements\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"mscD97HgEg\":\"Managed / Recurring\",\"mwHr7Se8D1\":\"Access to Claude’s latest models for reasoning, coding, and writing.\",\"mxnaO8gi08\":\"Claude lives inside Chrome, ready wherever you browse.\",\"myTIbit5tv\":\"Select partners\",\"mynHYVUSOV\":\"Nordics\",\"n469UeWQIf\":\"Download for ChromeOS\",\"n5D/KuWRGi\":\"Communication\",\"nEA1MxORgH\":\"For {role}\",\"nL8xcmnbjm\":\"Write the digest, what-to-watch first\",\"nOk9mhxGpU\":\"List\",\"nPtgyxpUd0\":\"How do I cancel my Claude subscription?\",\"nScLeP89Ov\":\"Migrate code\",\"nTMLK2RYtE\":\"Deployment Surface\",\"nUT0LvZVOx\":\"Tools\",\"nYokoOMWQh\":\"See solution\",\"nb4F4k82C7\":\"Search {text}\",\"nezp0LIXpQ\":\"Claude Code understands your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and helps you ship faster. It’s Anthropic’s agentic coding tool for your terminal and IDE.\",\"njpnaOi5/X\":\"Resume video\",\"noi6IWMyXA\":\"Project / Program\",\"npxjiYSnPH\":\"v3. Contractors moved to the ops budget.\",\"nx8x3WZ4/G\":\"enterprise security\",\"o+ToCFnM8m\":\"Turn on permissions settings so Claude shows its plan and waits for your approval. Redirect or stop anytime.\",\"o/AcDuEdCh\":\"Create what’s exciting. Maintain what’s essential.\",\"o4eiiyba8k\":\"Compare against Q1\",\"oEZ3tJt0N9\":\"Here’s a list of flagged sites. Visit each one, take a screenshot, and triage it against our trademark enforcement playbook. Rank them by priority.\",\"oFLooU1/QL\":\"{minutes} min remaining\",\"oGju2hB9//\":\"Compliance API\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"oKdO3Ime5c\":\"Build a social set for the Fall Readout using our brand guidelines. Three 4:5 posts — a stat, a headline, and a trend — as one proof sheet.\",\"oNedMwBIOc\":\"Fable included, up to half your weekly limit\",\"oNxIDnOk31\":\"Post the roll-up in-channel\",\"oUWADlOjJt\":\"No\",\"oZA/6fiLF8\":\"Partner tier\",\"ocMFdUoM0+\":\"{name} is available through the Claude Marketplace. If you have an existing Anthropic commitment, you can apply it here. Contact our team to find the right path for your organization.\",\"odMy5ERU7S\":\"Quick answers or long tasks\",\"ohjvu+C87x\":\"Active users\",\"onyxL5iLxe\":\"{count, plural, other {# more}}\",\"onz7SZxGnk\":\"Build Prototype / POC\",\"otTZisSg5A\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel from that app under Billing \u003e Manage subscription, or directly in your \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/b\u003e account.\",\"ox9wXewvNY\":\"Check the week’s meetings, next team sync Thursday\",\"p556q3uvbn\":\"Copied\",\"p64wBxVoxB\":\"Claude Code maps and explains large codebases in a few seconds. It uses agentic search to understand project structure and dependencies without you having to manually select context files.\",\"p6McXlpoIr\":\"Claude Code for every seat, with self-serve seat management and up to $500 per month in pooled API credits.\",\"p7f+VL1U+Y\":\"Swipe to see more\",\"p8Zpb+X9Sa\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Clau"])</script><script nonce="Ut3oYdma4O818PG+BaBRaw==">self.__next_f.push([1,"de Pro, Max, or Ultra plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. \u003ca\u003eDownload Claude Code\u003c/a\u003e and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"pCl8kahPwa\":\"Next testimonials\",\"pCyFJadqy/\":\"Simon Last, Co-founder\",\"pFZfPaYqm/\":\"n/a\",\"pGLybCbau7\":\"New connectors\",\"pJx1IlMdHc\":\"Each entry is a fixed snapshot of prices effective on the date shown.\",\"pK+9X32ExT\":\"Access tools\",\"pQmvynhfYT\":\"“\",\"pWPK7z+xaP\":\"{label} — steps\",\"pZ4CtGSlwT\":\"Try Claude\",\"pZf04BdODJ\":\"If you signed up on the web or the desktop app, go to \u003ca\u003eSettings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e and click Cancel.\",\"peouYNi1Sg\":\"Next featured resource\",\"phAZoj/lCl\":\"Collection\",\"pun/KVSUTp\":\"No connectors for those filters\",\"pwjQafECwL\":\"Powered by Claude\",\"pxF+t0PUQJ\":\"Popular\",\"q4mNBvfOdd\":\"Claude Slides\",\"q8HZmBhL9f\":\"$$200 a month in API credits, up from $100 on Max\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"qANDCowpHs\":\"Knowledge Retrieval \u0026 Enterprise Search\",\"qSEmqaxK/a\":\"Download desktop app\",\"qWb1zA13jM\":\"Rank by risk, critical first\",\"qank7+0V6w\":\"Continue with SSO\",\"qcDygS25FQ\":\"Brief\",\"qhHpS4CiBR\":\"Get Enterprise plan\",\"qoMwDfFqSS\":\"Post the running list to #product-team\",\"qq7/bDb1zJ\":\"Your thinking partner for big ambitions\",\"qqW8aMzEzp\":\"Training Package\",\"qsluU7sYQR\":\"Company size:\",\"r/7WfhmG3M\":\"Matching five transcripts to three open opportunities\",\"r/R93LFqEp\":\"Connectors and plugins\",\"r8XsCUEvou\":\"Connector\",\"rClne6thca\":\"Check this job description against our leveling guide. Give me back an edited version and an interview kit.\",\"rCwYJ1AtP0\":\"financial services\",\"rFNJ5GIHwJ\":\"The challenge\",\"rIAJlEKVw9\":\"Added\",\"rMfXlJqFrP\":\"1x\",\"rNKFHm2P6a\":\"Research case law on this issue in our jurisdiction. Verify citations against CourtListener, summarize the controlling precedent, and draft a memo on how it applies to our matter.\",\"rTFm2huXkK\":\"What you can do\",\"rUSV9GH+x6\":\"Opt-out\",\"rbrahOGMC3\":\"Close\",\"rfycQ8j6IA\":\"Use case details\",\"riqC8uzyv1\":\"Education plan\",\"rjeRzhM7pX\":\"Research \u0026 Intelligence\",\"rnb9d/6z90\":\"View more\",\"rrYb0J+gGk\":\"Register once and we’ll send you the details for every session.\",\"rsNxxABBT7\":\"Read documentation\",\"rssHel8myN\":\"Create and edit files with code execution\",\"ruV1XSR19T\":\"Domain capture\",\"ruo+K7xIaj\":\"Admin controls for remote and local connectors\",\"rvirM238ZE\":\"Location\",\"s1njKoT8b8\":\"Expand resources canvas\",\"s6CiWwAAlT\":\"Middle East \u0026 Africa\",\"sFlniVMOTp\":\"Claude Docs\",\"sbCcyNpP/9\":\"Admins set access by team, manage spend limits, and control tool permissions by department. Activity streams to your SIEM through OpenTelemetry.\",\"sdKwU38Eo/\":\"Add the tools {category} teams use every day.\",\"sgTGYsZYPT\":\"Default tier for both piloting and scaling everyday use cases\",\"snqlu2y0xx\":\"On demand\",\"soN6WFjyyQ\":\"Features and capabilities\",\"srwgz/e2SQ\":\"Billing and payments\",\"ssfxGtVpUg\":\"There are three Meridians in the CRM — the health one has a meeting on your calendar today. Want the whole account history, or just what’s changed since the last call?\",\"stJYEYsqnV\":\"{current} of {total}\",\"sy7vzf+1SO\":\"Scheduled tasks\",\"szo1Q6XDyE\":\"Team and self-serve Enterprise: an Owner or Primary Owner cancels under \u003ca\u003eOrganization settings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"t/JCKd7Rat\":\"Sales \u0026 marketing\",\"t/QGDExlfi\":\"Asset creation\",\"t0clKd0XbN\":\"Windows (arm64)\",\"t31v0g8Oxk\":\"Separating the price beat from the volume story\",\"tF9rgXap+C\":\"Webinar\",\"tFrzx0/fBv\":\"Set up work Claude runs again on a schedule you choose.\",\"tHSb8p10Ty\":\"Desktop\",\"tI/qaSnHPB\":\"\u003cb\u003e10x Pro usage\u003c/b\u003e every week*\",\"tL5vvEz2a5\":\"What you’ll learn\",\"tN6YfTPvWf\":\"Add to Preferred Sources\",\"tOzrfLgcls\":\"Claude Code can handle routine work like bug fixes and testing, and larger jobs like refactors and new features that are long-running and asynchronous.\",\"tTZcGGL9Ip\":\"Balance availability, performance, and predictable costs based on your needs.\",\"tarJilR3bR\":\"How does Claude Code work with my existing tools?\",\"tf1lIh/bri\":\"Free\",\"thCLWnYR9C\":\"Partner:\",\"tpF1rBQlbd\":\"Other series\",\"tv5FG3fVPd\":\"Blog\",\"txAZOVZLpP\":\"Get up to 2.5x faster speeds with fast mode for Opus 5.5 at 2x standard pr"])</script><script nonce="Ut3oYdma4O818PG+BaBRaw==">self.__next_f.push([1,"icing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"tyUvBVYIqg\":\"Turn the engagement survey export into the exec readout, same shape as last wave.\",\"u1OoLp8wpX\":\"Daily driver for agentic coding and enterprise work\",\"u54zeRyqZw\":\"Enterprise (sales-assisted)\",\"u8g3BII/vI\":\"Use Claude Code where you work\",\"uEHuz5FdGy\":\"Calendar\",\"uX+l4+Y5ZN\":\"Pull web views and sign-ups, Aug 17–23\",\"uXTVe2kYXt\":\"Chats that aren't saved to your history, added to memory, or used to train Claude.\",\"uYh787opQc\":\"Usage credits\",\"ubrk8HaZUC\":\"Pull ad spend by channel\",\"ujPAwMcyiK\":\"Pick a role\",\"urOpUxb/N9\":\"Resources for successful adoption across your institution\",\"uxizPhnuqF\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Prices shown don't include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"uywgBgBuE8\":\"Scheduled for 7:45am Mondays, before standup\",\"v+4jHj0z9q\":\"Build comparison sheet\",\"v/CiLjmO+2\":\"{title} (opens in new tab)\",\"v1CldtkxV3\":\"Network-level access control\",\"v5OlYwdff3\":\"Triage against the trademark playbook, v4\",\"v9V3eCMg8n\":\"The web\",\"vCO+UdkZFA\":\"Triage issues\",\"vEF59Ugqd6\":\"Guide\",\"vKMj39KhGw\":\"Claude Code\",\"vL82O8vzlo\":\"Request to buy\",\"vMZxqST6IA\":\"Integrate with your editor\",\"vPWmZjju8T\":\" — {title}\",\"vUw2hsGbY1\":\"Webinar series\",\"vVN22M1qGv\":\"Limit every 5 hours\",\"vYinyg2E+0\":\"Process Redesign\",\"vatCWUigd1\":\"Watch the webinar\",\"vbFKkTYpN+\":\"See plans\",\"vcxsGEi5U7\":\"If you can dream it, Claude can help you do it. Claude can process large amounts of information, brainstorm ideas, generate text and code, help you understand subjects, coach you through difficult situations, simplify your busywork so you can focus on what matters most, and so much more.\",\"vdH+AniQsJ\":\"\u003cb\u003eLimited usage\u003c/b\u003e every 5 hours and every week\",\"vgDovOlJoC\":\"Restrict org creation\",\"vhBuSQQwT8\":\"No matches for “{query}” across connectors, plugins, products, or partners.\",\"vjjcLxOenJ\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits\u003c/a\u003e apply.\",\"vk9SGKd88w\":\"Using the People readout skill, so the shape matches last wave\",\"vox7qN7azl\":\"View use case\",\"vt9Gy7rhLn\":\"Company Size\",\"vwbw+n92T7\":\"Webinar\",\"vzkkN2jQqo\":\"Claude Marketplace\",\"w0lpGgj9J9\":\"Build your own connectors and MCPs, including local desktop extensions.\",\"wB8Eqc+qG4\":\"Talk to Claude instead of typing.\",\"wIZFIV6YhG\":\"Top connectors\",\"wK